        "subject": "LU-20821 tests: skip OSS nodes without ost_io in cleanup_123aj",
        "message": "LU-20821 tests: skip OSS nodes without ost_io in cleanup_123aj\n\ncleanup_123aj() restores nrs_policies=fifo on every OSS node\nreturned by osts_nodes().  If an earlier test leaves only ost1\nmounted, an OSS node with no active OST has no ost.OSS.ost_io\ndevice.  The set_param then returns non-zero and marks an\notherwise successful test_123aj as FAIL.\n\nCheck the parameter exists on each OSS node before restoring it,\nand treat the per-node restore as best effort, matching the\nexisting best-effort MGS cleanup commands.\n\nFixes: f69f27cc35 (\"LU-17920 mgs: handle compound permanent parameters\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Xiyang Wang <xiwang@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: I7f28fe5156c266b5465eb750a5b08a0210bf4ec9\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
